## Port of pumpkin/src/server/mod.rs
## PARTIAL: pumpkin/src/server/mod.rs - construction from a save, all three dimensions, `add_player`, `remove_player`, lookups, counts (`has_n_players`), `for_each_player`, `broadcast_tab_list_header_footer`, branding, status, the tick and the tick-rate manager, recipe manager, key store and `data/`; plugins start in `loadServer`, the command dispatcher is commandbridge.aowl and advancements are advancementglue.aowl. Not here: `new_container_id` (containers number themselves per player here), `spawn_task` (single-threaded). The types are in serverbase.aowl.

